Description: Monitor NVIDIA GPU activity from R through NVML.
    The package collects device-level metrics and active compute process
    information over time. It can annotate runs with event markers and
    visualize the resulting session data, helping users profile
    GPU-accelerated R and Bioconductor workflows.
